{%- comment -%}
  Cover image override map, from the client's product-code sheet
  (CATEGORY WISE COVER PHOTOS). Outputs an asset filename for a known
  collection handle, or nothing if that handle has no override yet -
  callers fall back to the collection's own image / first product photo.
  Keyed by the collection's CURRENT real handle (not its title - handles
  and titles don't match on this store after the collection restructure;
  see the comment block at the top of vamas-collection.liquid).

  Handle -> real current title -> source:
    occasion-wear-copy          -> DUAL NECK BLOUSES        -> X-1343 INDIGO
    dual-neck-blouses-copy      -> SIDE STRETCH BLOUSES      -> X-1216 MAROON
    side-stretch-blouses        -> SIDE STRETCH BLOUSES      -> X-1216 MAROON (Plain Edit's "Plain Side Stretch Blouses")
    brocade-bohemia-copy        -> THE KANJIVARAM COMPANION  -> X-1226 MAROON
    re-verse-by-vamas-copy      -> BROCADE BOHEMIA           -> client-supplied photo
    the-kanjivaram-companion-copy -> BRIGERTON INSPIRED SERIES -> client-supplied photo
    corsets                     -> CORSETS                   -> CS-9 BLACK
    signature-sleeveless        -> Signature Sleeveless      -> X-1205 BOTTLE-GREEN
    timeless-elbow-length       -> Timeless Elbow Length     -> X-1206 WINE
    classic-cottons             -> CLASSIC COTTONS           -> X-1248 PINK
    royal-collar-necks          -> ROYAL COLLAR NECKS        -> X-1318 NAVY-BLUE
    corsets-copy                -> EVERYDAY COTTONS          -> X-1329 HT
    brezzy-prints-copy          -> CROCHE LINE               -> VFJ-256
    croche-line-copy            -> HALDI AND MEHENDI         -> X-1321
    haldi-and-mehendi-copy      -> WEDDING WEAR              -> KP-295 DARK-RED
    party-wear-copy             -> PRAYER MEET BLOUSES       -> X-1242 WHITE
    one-of-a-kind-blouses-copy  -> KASHMIRI WORK             -> B-192 FS BLACK

